# ratelimit.nft
#
# Loaded by entrypoint.sh at container start, before it drops to the
# ldap user. At most 100 new connections a second reach LDAPS on 636;
# the rest are dropped while the flood lasts, and the client's TCP stack
# retries them. Below 100 a second nothing is touched, so the limit lifts
# by itself when the traffic quiets down.
#
# Copyright (C) 2026 George Marselis <george.marselis@vetinst.no>
#
# This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
